{"unit_id":"tag:03AO:title","translation":"<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 上同调（cohomology）作为预层（presheaves）上的函子（functor）","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"Čech 上同调，待批准"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"函子的定义域，待批准"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"预层上的上同调函子，待批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03AO:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n警告：本节仅讨论范畴（category）上的阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）。在层（sheaves）及层（sheaves）的范畴（categories）的情形中，这些结果完全错误！\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。设 <MATH_0002> 为靶固定的态射族（family of morphisms），使得所有纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003> 都在 <MATH_0004> 中存在。设 <MATH_0005> 为 <MATH_0006> 上的阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）。构造 <MATH_0007> 关于 <MATH_0008> 具有函子性（functorial）。事实上，它是函子（functor）\n<MATH_0009>；记号见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》定义 <REF_0001>。回忆，一个阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）中有下界（bounded below）的复形（complexes）所成的范畴（category）是阿贝尔范畴（abelian category），见《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0002>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"具有函子性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"有下界"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"预层及复形范畴，待批准"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔","context":"预层的系数类型，待批准"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"本节对象，待批准"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"警告中的适用边界，待批准"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term"